<title>UK: Sara Lee sets 250 million guilder Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Sara Lee sets 250 million guilder Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SARA LEE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    19.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.145   PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.77     SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.75 PCT SEP.01 DSL / 8.25 PCT FEB.02 DSL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
